---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/contact.html"
title: "Request a call back | dataleasers"
description: "Request a call back with dataleasers to see whether your company's data could be licensed for AI, through an introduction to the data buyer."
canonical: "https://dataleasers.com/contact.html"
navKey: contact
---
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero ink">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Request a call back</h1>
      <p class="lead">Tell us a little about your company. We will reply to arrange a short conversation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section mist">
    <div class="wrap reveal">
      <p class="notice-ok" id="form-sent" hidden>Thank you. We will reply to arrange a call.</p>
      <p class="notice-err" id="form-error" hidden>Something went wrong, or a field was not valid. Please check and try again.</p>
      <form action="https://app.dataleasers.com/api/leads" method="post">
        <label>Name
          <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="200">
        </label>
        <label>Work email
          <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="320">
        </label>
        <label>Company
          <input type="text" name="company" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="200">
        </label>
        <label>Your role
          <input type="text" name="role" maxlength="200">
        </label>
        <label>What kind of data does your company generate?
          <textarea name="data" maxlength="2000"></textarea>
        </label>
        <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
          <label>Leave this empty<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
        </div>
        <p><button class="btn" type="submit">Request a call back</button></p>
      </form>
      <p class="muted small-note">We use these details only to reply to your enquiry. See <a href="trust.html">How we handle your data</a>.</p>
      <script>
        (function () {
          var q = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
          if (q.get('sent')) document.getElementById('form-sent').hidden = false;
          if (q.get('error')) document.getElementById('form-error').hidden = false;
        })();
      </script>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
